<p style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0in"><br />
</p>
<p style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0in" align="center"><font color="#ff0000"><font
face="Arial, sans-serif"><font size="4"><strong>&lt;&gt;&lt; &lt;&gt;&lt;
&lt;&gt;&lt; &lt;&gt;&lt; &lt;&gt;&lt; &lt;&gt;&lt; &lt;&gt;&lt;
&lt;&gt;&lt; &lt;&gt;&lt; &lt;&gt;&lt; &lt;&gt;&lt; &lt;&gt;&lt;
&lt;&gt;&lt;</strong></font></font></font></p>
<p style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0in"><br />
</p>
<p style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0in" align="center"><font face="Arial,
sans-serif"><strong>Where Angels Walk</strong></font></p>
<p style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0in"><br />
</p>
<p style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0in"><font color="#000000"><font face="Arial,
sans-serif"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt" size="2">Steve explained that
despite his mother being 93 years old, she still visited needy people, and
would bring food, medicine or anything else they needed. One day she had
been in a house where the driveway wound through heavy brush and trees
right into a very busy highway. Now, attempting to back out, she could
barely see the oncoming traffic, and realized how difficult and dangerous
the conditions were. &ldquo;Finally,&rdquo; said Steve, &ldquo;it looked
clear, and she gunned the engine and reversed out of the driveway.&rdquo;
Too late she realized that a huge truck was bearing down on her car, now
halfway out in the road. She cried out to God.</font></font></font></p>
<p style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0in"><br />
</p>
<p style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0in"><font color="#000000"><font face="Arial,
sans-serif"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt" size="2">Then Steve&rsquo;s
mother saw an enormous angel behind her car. The angel put its hand on the
truck&rsquo;s hood and slowed it long enough so she could completely back
up, and then drive forward. As she did so, the angel faded away, but there
was now plenty of room between her and the truck.</font></font></font></p>
<p style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0in"><br />
</p>
<p style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0in"><font color="#000000"><font face="Arial,
sans-serif"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt" size="2">The elderly woman wanted
to believe what she had seen, but was it true? And who would believe her if
she told anyone? She wondered if the trucker himself had seen anything
unusual. Could it have been her imagination?</font></font></font></p>
<p style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0in"><br />
</p>
<p style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0in"><font color="#000000"><font face="Arial,
sans-serif"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt" size="2">At about the same time,
there was a preacher living nearby. He was devout and loved the Lord, but
he wasn&rsquo;t exactly convinced that angels existed. For awhile, he had
been asking God to instruct him, and if there were indeed angels, to show
him in some way.</font></font></font></p>
<p style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0in"><br />
</p>
<p style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0in"><font color="#000000"><font face="Arial,
sans-serif"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt" size="2">On a particular morning,
he was driving down a highway that was always quite busy. Ahead of him, on
the other side, he saw an elderly woman attempting to back out into the
road. However, he could see what she didn&rsquo;t---there was a truck
bearing down on her. The trucker probably hadn&rsquo;t seen her yet, but
when he did, there wouldn&rsquo;t be enough time to avoid a
crash.</font></font></font></p>
<p style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0in"><br />
</p>
<p style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0in"><font color="#000000"><font face="Arial,
sans-serif"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt" size="2">Then the preacher saw
something wonderful! A huge winged angel appeared between the two vehicles.
Gracefully, the angel reached over to the truck, now within a short
distance from the car. The angel touched the truck&rsquo;s hood, and it
slowed immediately. That few seconds helped the other driver pull her car
into the road, and proceed safely.</font></font></font></p>
<p style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0in"><br />
</p>
<p style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0in"><font color="#000000"><font face="Arial,
sans-serif"><font style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt" size="2">The preacher, stunned
beyond words, went home and wrote up his experience, sending it to a
popular angel magazine, where Steve&rsquo;s mother read it and realized
that there was indeed a witness to her miracle. Whether the two ever met,
we don&rsquo;t know. But they both received what they needed
most.</font></font></font></p>
<p style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0in"><br />
</p>
